                        "entry_id": "6b27f6c3-b6ed-3535-b2f7-78c0eaf9b3af",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An insect, Daktulosphaira vitifoliae of the family Phylloxeridae (not the genus Phylloxera), that is very destructive to grape vines; also, the diseased condition of a vine caused by this insect."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1185bfc6-af82-4d7b-9aff-cd859b807ac7",
                                "sense_id": "57e39763-5873-3b1b-a486-300d27b953a8",
                                "text": "thirty-five years later the coming of phylloxera to France launched the Algerian wine industry, and by the mid-twentieth century it had grown to be one of the Mediterranean's biggest producers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
